flowchart LR
  pos[原POS攻击字段] --> packet[原Move/Value消息]
  packet --> move[Move轨迹倍率]
  packet --> time[Value最低时长]
  amb[原AMB d_base] --> sample[Web场景轨迹采样]
  move --> sample
  time --> player[原帧边界播放器]
  player --> sample
  sample --> collision[统一墙体/地面/险地检测]
  collision --> actor[碰撞根与镜头]
  player --> skin[原骨骼/挂点/攻击窗]
